&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Excellent written communication and structured thinking, with the ability to turn complex inputs into crisp narratives and leadership-ready materials.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Analytical fluency: comfortable working with performance metrics and basic financial concepts, and able to pressure-test assumptions and identify gaps.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
