&lt;li&gt;Push the envelope on our operational efficiency by continually refining and advancing our algorithms and models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an active member of the Economics team, sharing learnings, best practices, and research across domains while refining and advancing our algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
